    featuredImagePrompt: "A wide-angle, awe-inspiring scene of deep space. In the foreground, subtly integrated, a highly detailed, futuristic rendering of NASA's Roman Space Telescope, its mirror reflecting distant galaxies. In the mid-ground, a glowing, large reddish-orange supergiant star (Betelgeuse) with a smaller, bright stellar companion visibly orbiting it. The background features a vibrant, intricate nebula and a starfield, with distant galaxies visible, emphasizing the vastness of the universe. The overall tone is one of wonder, discovery, and scientific advancement. Lighting is dramatic, with subtle lens flares. The scene should convey both the grand scale of the universe and the precision of modern astronomical observation. Avoid any human elements or specific country flags.",
