    featuredImagePrompt: "A vibrant, abstract conceptual visual representing India's economic growth. Swirling lines of light and data symbolizing FPI inflows and digital transformation converging towards a glowing, stylized outline of India. Interspersed with subtle, futuristic icons representing innovative startups, rising unicorn horns, and interconnected telecom networks. The composition should feel dynamic and forward-looking, blending traditional Indian design motifs with modern tech aesthetics. Use a warm, optimistic color palette featuring gold, saffron, and deep blues. Wide-angle, cinematic perspective with a sense of upward movement and prosperity. Avoid any specific people or literal buildings.",
