    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a dynamic composition. In the foreground, a stylized SpaceX Starship rocket is launching upwards, intertwined with an ascending stock market graph with candlestick patterns. The background subtly depicts Earth from space with a network of Starlink satellites orbiting. Digital currency symbols and abstract data points float around, symbolizing the financial aspect of the space economy. A bold, clean 'SpaceX IPO' title is integrated into the design. The color palette should be professional, incorporating deep blues, metallic silvers, and vibrant greens, with subtle gold accents highlighting financial growth. High-resolution, modern graphic design, suitable for a financial news publication cover, with elements arranged for visual impact and clarity.",
