      bearCase: "Despite robust anchor interest, the broader Indian market faces valuation concerns, and global liquidity conditions remain dynamic. Dhoot Transmission operates in a cyclical industry, exposing it to potential downturns in the automotive sector. Lack of full financial details in the provided sources makes a comprehensive valuation assessment challenging, and future earnings delivery will be critical to justify the IPO\'s upper price band.",
