    risks: ["Continued regulatory uncertainty hindering innovation and economic growth in the U.S. digital asset sector.", "Risk of U.S. companies and talent migrating to more crypto-friendly jurisdictions.", "Inconsistent investor protection due to fragmented regulatory oversight.", "Potential for regulatory arbitrage and market manipulation in the absence of clear rules.", "Increased compliance costs for businesses navigating a complex and unpredictable legal landscape.", "Loss of global leadership in developing blockchain and digital finance standards."],
